flowchart LR
    A[Zombie Process] --> B[Child calls exit]
    B --> C[Kernel frees resources]
    C --> D[Saves exit status]
    D --> E[Becomes zombie Z]
    
    E --> F{Parent calls wait?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Parent reaps zombie]
    G --> H[Exit status retrieved]
    H --> I[Process fully terminated]
    
    F -->|No| J[Zombie persists]
    J --> K[Parent exits]
    K --> L[init PID 1 adopts]
    L --> M[init reaps zombie]
    M --> I
    
    N[Orphan Process] --> O[Parent exits first]
    O --> P[Child still running]
    P --> Q[init PID 1 adopts]
    Q --> R[Child runs normally]
    R --> S[Child exits]
    S --> T[init reaps immediately]
    
    U[Checking] --> V["ps aux | grep -w Z"]
    V --> W["PID USER STAT Z defunct"]
    
    style E fill:#fff4e1
    style J fill:#ffe1e1
    style Q fill:#e8f5e8
